---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Legal and compliance | Bloc Microfinance Bank" description="Bloc licences, regulatory compliance, policies and how to make a complaint. Licensed by the CBN, deposits insured by the NDIC." path="/legal/" section="company" breadcrumb={[{"name": "Legal and compliance", "path": "/legal/"}]}>
<section class="iph"><div class="w"><div class="ihl">
<nav class="crumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span>Legal and compliance</span></nav>
<h1>Legal and compliance.</h1>
<p class="lead">Our licences, policies and how to raise a complaint.</p>

</div></div></section><section class="sec" id="licences"><div class="w">
<div class="lab "><i class="ch"></i><span>Licences and regulation</span></div>
<h2>Who regulates Bloc.</h2>
<div class="grid3">
<div class="ipc"><div class="tl"><img width="141" height="150" src="/assets/reg-cbn.png" alt="Licensed by the CBN logo"></div><h3>Licensed by the CBN</h3><p>Bloc Microfinance Bank holds a microfinance bank licence from the Central Bank of Nigeria.</p><div class="kv">Licence number FPR/LAD/CON/MFB/010/066</div></div>
<div class="ipc"><div class="tl"><img width="420" height="178" src="/assets/reg-ndic.png" alt="Insured by the NDIC logo"></div><h3>Insured by the NDIC</h3><p>Deposits are insured by the Nigeria Deposit Insurance Corporation, subject to its limits.</p><div class="kv">Cover Up to ₦5 million, subject to NDIC terms</div></div>
<div class="ipc"><div class="tl"><img width="160" height="160" src="/assets/reg-ndpc.png" alt="NDPA compliant logo"></div><h3>NDPA compliant</h3><p>We handle personal data under the Nigeria Data Protection Act.</p><div class="kv">Data protection contact support@blocmfb.com</div></div>
</div></div></section><section class="sec" id="practice"><div class="w">
<div class="lab "><i class="ch"></i><span>How we stay compliant</span></div>
<h2>Standards we work to.</h2>
<div class="grid3">
<div class="ipc"><div class="ipi"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg></div><h3>Anti-money laundering</h3><p>We follow CBN regulations and the Money Laundering (Prohibition) Act, with KYC checks, transaction monitoring and suspicious activity reporting.</p></div>
<div class="ipc"><div class="ipi"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="2" width="16" height="20" rx="2"/><path d="M9 22v-4h6v4"/><path d="M8 6h.01M12 6h.01M16 6h.01M8 10h.01M12 10h.01M16 10h.01M8 14h.01M12 14h.01M16 14h.01"/></svg></div><h3>CBN requirements</h3><p>As a CBN-licensed microfinance bank, we follow its guidelines, including capital adequacy, prudential standards and periodic reporting.</p></div>
<div class="ipc"><div class="ipi"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg></div><h3>Data protection</h3><p>We process personal data lawfully, for a stated purpose, and collect only what we need, keeping it secure and confidential.</p></div>
<div class="ipc"><div class="ipi"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2"/><path d="M12 18h.01"/></svg></div><h3>Information security</h3><p>Encryption, access controls, regular security audits and incident response procedures protect customer data and our systems.</p></div>
<div class="ipc"><div class="ipi"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg></div><h3>Fraud prevention</h3><p>Real-time transaction monitoring, multi-factor authentication, staff training and customer awareness.</p></div>
<div class="ipc"><div class="ipi"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg></div><h3>Consumer protection</h3><p>We follow the CBN Consumer Protection Framework: transparent pricing, fair treatment and effective complaint resolution.</p></div>
</div></div></section><section class="sec sky" id="policies"><div class="w split2"><div>
<div class="lab "><i class="ch"></i><span>Policies and terms</span></div>
<h2>The documents behind your account.</h2>
<p class="lead">Read the terms and policies that apply to Bloc accounts.</p></div>
<div class="ipl"><a class="ipr" href="/terms-of-service/"><span class="ipi"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6"/><path d="M8 13h8M8 17h8"/></svg></span><span class="rt"><b>Terms of service</b><span>Read online</span></span><span class="rg">Read <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5"/><path d="M12 15V3"/></svg></span></a><a class="ipr" href="/privacy-policy/"><span class="ipi"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6"/><path d="M8 13h8M8 17h8"/></svg></span><span class="rt"><b>Privacy policy</b><span>Read online</span></span><span class="rg">Read <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5"/><path d="M12 15V3"/></svg></span></a><a class="ipr" href="/privacy-notice/"><span class="ipi"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6"/><path d="M8 13h8M8 17h8"/></svg></span><span class="rt"><b>Privacy notice</b><span>Read online</span></span><span class="rg">Read <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5"/><path d="M12 15V3"/></svg></span></a><a class="ipr" href="#practice"><span class="ipi"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6"/><path d="M8 13h8M8 17h8"/></svg></span><span class="rt"><b>CBN disclosure and data protection compliance</b><span>Read online</span></span><span class="rg">Read <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5"/><path d="M12 15V3"/></svg></span></a><a class="ipr" href="/charges/"><span class="ipi"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6"/><path d="M8 13h8M8 17h8"/></svg></span><span class="rt"><b>Charges and rates</b><span>Page · Effective <span class="pf">[date]</span></span></span><span class="rg">Download <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5"/><path d="M12 15V3"/></svg></span></a></div></div></section><section class="sec" id="complaints"><div class="w split2"><div>
<div class="lab "><i class="ch"></i><span>Complaints</span></div>
<h2>If something goes wrong.</h2>
<p class="lead">Tell us. We will look into it and keep you updated.</p></div>
<div class="steps" style="margin-top:0"><div class="step"><div class="num">1</div><div><b>Tell us</b><span>Chat with us in the app, or email <a class="ul2" href="mailto:support@blocmfb.com">support@blocmfb.com</a>.</span></div></div><div class="step"><div class="num">2</div><div><b>We look into it</b><span>We confirm we have it and reply within 24 working days.</span></div></div><div class="step"><div class="num">3</div><div><b>Not resolved?</b><span>You can take your complaint to the Central Bank of Nigeria. <span class="pf">[compliance to confirm wording and contact]</span></span></div></div></div></div></section>
</Layout>
